# deploy/vps/slopdrop/stock-proxy.filter — /etc/veles/slopdrop-stock-proxy.filter
# The hosts slopdrop's stock proxy lets it reach (tinyproxy FilterType
# ere, matched against the host name; anything else is refused 403).
# Yahoo's chart API, which stock::quote/price/detail/history/chart call
# (yahoo_finance_api's YCHART_URL), on either of its two hosts.
^query[12]\.finance\.yahoo\.com$
